te":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-09-21T15:38:47Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T08:56:11Z","closed_at":"2026-09-21T15:45:25Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123677","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123677","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123677.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123677.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"> [!INFO]\r\n> *AI disclosure*: This contribution was authored by AI agent, on behalf of a user, to fix the project manager keyboard focus handling described in #38018.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Pressing Enter while a sidebar button such as **Remove** has keyboard focus opens the selected project instead of activating the focused button.\r\n\r\n## How does this PR solve the problem?\r\n\r\nThe project manager previously handled Enter globally in\r\n`ProjectManager::shortcut_input()`.\r\n\r\nThis moves the project-opening behavior to the focused project list item.\r\nAs a result:\r\n\r\n- Enter opens a project when a project list item is focused.\r\n- Enter submits the search box through its existing `text_submitted` handler.\r\n- Enter activates focused sidebar buttons through their normal `ui_accept`\r\n  handling.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\n- Focused **Remove** and pressed Enter: the removal confirmation opens.\r\n- Focused a project list item and pressed Enter: the project opens.\r\n- Focused the search box and pressed Enter: the selected project opens.","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123677/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123677/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}